[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2789403727","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105186#issuecomment-2789403727","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105186","id":2789403727,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mQuxP","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T11:43:50Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T11:43:50Z","body":"Please provide an MRP to make this easier to test and fix:\n- A small Godot project which reproduces the issue, with no unnecessary files included. Be sure to not include the `.godot` folder in the archive (but keep `project.godot`).\n- Having an MRP is very important for contributors to be able to reproduce the bug in the same way that you are experiencing it. When testing a potential fix for the issue, contributors will use the MRP to validate that the fix is working as intended.\n- Drag and drop a ZIP archive to upload it (max 10 MB). **Do not select another field until the project is done uploading.**\n- **Note for C# users:** If your issue is *not* C#-specific, please upload a minimal reproduction project written in GDScript. This will make it easier for contributors to reproduce the issue locally as not everyone has a .NET setup available. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2789403727/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2789527214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105186#issuecomment-2789527214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105186","id":2789527214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mRM6u","user":{"login":"Mewlkor","id":116582174,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvLnHg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116582174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mewlkor","html_url":"https://github.com/Mewlkor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mewlkor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mewlkor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mewlkor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mewlkor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mewlkor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mewlkor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mewlkor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mewlkor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mewlkor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T12:24:28Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T12:24:28Z","body":"[fog_rendering_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19666647/fog_rendering_mrp.zip)\nHere is a mrp.\nUsage:\n1) Ensure project has transparent viewport: Project Settings -> Viewport -> Transparent Background should already be enabled\n2) Open the scene test_with_fogvolume in the editor\n3) The fogvolume should not be visible. Clicking on the camera, the small preview should show the fogvolume.\n4) When starting the scene, the fog should not be visible.\n5) Disable Transparent Background in project settings.\nThe fog should now work correctly.\n\nThe second scene is using the test_with_fogvolume scene but encapsulates this scene in a subviewport. \nUsage:\n1) Ensure Subviewport -> Transparent bg is enabled.\n2) When starting this scene the fog should not be visible. \n3) When disabling Transparent bg, the fog should work correctly.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2789527214/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2791413799","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105186#issuecomment-2791413799","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105186","id":2791413799,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mYZgn","user":{"login":"trullin-umich","id":195618520,"node_id":"U_kgDOC6jm2A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195618520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trullin-umich","html_url":"https://github.com/trullin-umich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trullin-umich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trullin-umich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trullin-umich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trullin-umich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trullin-umich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trullin-umich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trullin-umich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trullin-umich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trullin-umich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-10T02:48:26Z","updated_at":"2025-04-10T02:48:26Z","body":"**Hi there,**\n\nApologies if you're getting a lot of messages from students lately. I'm also a student currently looking for open source work for a final project, and I've been a fan of Godot for a while. Would it be okay if I tried to take a stab at this issue?\n\nIf it's not a great fit, feel free to point me toward something more beginner-friendly, I'd really appreciate any guidance. Thanks so much, and sorry again for adding to the noise!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2791413799/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2791932733","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105186#issuecomment-2791932733","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105186","id":2791932733,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6maYM9","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organiz