:"2025-04-11T10:28:02Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T10:28:02Z","body":"I did some testing. Volumetric fog needs an opaque base layer. This is not given with a transparent viewport since the viewport has no opaque background. This is related to issue #103688 since it is another symptom of incorrect viewport alpha handling, since the viewport transparency shouldn't affect if there is any fog rendered.  ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2796514076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]